{"id":"vod_sn_37209","vodId":"37209","provider":"sn","providerName":"索尼资源","type":2,"name":"鬼斩","name_cn":"鬼斩","date":"2016-01-01","year":"2016","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"已完结","images":{"common":"https://snzypic.vip/upload/vod/20230911-1/34becf2255cfc2f22a5f0863fa90f355.jpg"},"summary":"故事发生在异世界中，在这里，被称为“噬神者”的鬼怪潜伏在人群之中，散播着恐惧和危险。在一场浩浩荡荡而又旷日持久的战争之后，人类终于以伤亡惨重为代价将噬神者们封印在了三层结界之后，然而随着时间的流逝，第一层结界碎裂了，这也就意味着，如果坐视不管的话，数百年前的悲剧将要重演。　　就在这个危急关头，身形纤弱但拥有着强大力量的少女们出现了。天真乐观的静御前（铃木爱奈 配音）、温柔冷静的义经（松井惠理子 配音）、嗜酒如命的茨木童子（三森铃子 配音）、捉摸不透的辉夜（橘田泉 配音）、可爱娇小的天照（原奈津子 配音），这些少女们要对抗的，是名为“撒旦”的最强噬神者。","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2023-09-11 15:50:05","playable":true,"episodeCount":13,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"snm3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第01集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/EpG0jfgTVi1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/2nXWm1HAyx1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/xgFXVybJNE1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/cRp1sc4YB81/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/X0aqEQcViC1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/CXGHuTHBkU1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/nKjBNf9YiF1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/NNEChRySGV1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/R5Ncf5s04w1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/UTdTVGEXcm1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/Cm3xf93Uqh1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/tcwZJTm8Ms1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第13集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/g5dYx3CWHm1/video/index.m3u8"}]}],"snapshotAt":"2026-10-22T15:45:13.586Z"}